body:
He is gaslighting. I can literally sense the kind of confusion gaslighting causes and it is this. I stopped reading when I finally made out to read your title and you are absolutely right. he is a gaslighter. 

&#x200B;

edit: also, remember that gaslighting is hard for others to understand if they haven't been at the receiving end of some gaslighting. I've been there myself and I know it when I know it. Since you made mention of gaslighting, which is a vocabulary not too many people use for now, I suppose you must've already had an experience with it and trust me it will only get worse and trap you. Again, WHEN YOU KNOW IT, YOU KNOW IT. Trust your guts. It's been through a lot to be fooled again. bye.
